{"id":"gonsin-001","question":"排查无线热点干扰时，电脑端和手机端分别可使用什么工具？","referenceAnswer":"电脑端可使用 wifiinfoview，手机端可使用 iNetBox app。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"无线网络","tags":["事实型","工具"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"interference-tools","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-1"],"sectionPath":"锂电池使用注意事项","quoteText":"PC端可用wifiinfoview，手机端可用iNetBox app。"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[],"requiredRelations":[]}}
{"id":"gonsin-002","question":"无线 AP 的发射功率和天线特性是什么？哪些摆放方式通常不建议采用？","referenceAnswer":"无线 AP 发射功率为 100mW（23dB），天线为单面特性；通常不建议平置、放在机柜内或机柜顶部，也不建议放在与无线通信设备隔断的机房内。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"无线网络","tags":["参数型","操作建议"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"ap-power-placement","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-1"],"quoteText":"无线 AP 的 AP 发射功率为 100mw，23dB；天线特性为单面。"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[],"requiredRelations":[]}}
{"id":"gonsin-003","question":"锂电池长期不用时应如何保存和维护？","referenceAnswer":"应将锂电池卸下单独存放，并至少每三个月充至饱和；充电箱章节另建议长期不用时每 3～4 个月充放电一次，但不要充满或彻底放电到设备无法开机，以免深度放电损伤电池。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"安全维护","tags":["跨段综合","电池"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"battery-storage","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-1","55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-2"],"quoteText":"锂电池长期闲置会导致电量过低造成电池损坏"}]},{"id":"battery-cycle","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-7"],"quoteText":"如果电池长期不用，有必要在 3～4 个月内充放电一次"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[{"canonicalName":"long_idle"},{"canonicalName":"battery"}],"requiredRelations":[{"sourceEntity":"long_idle","relationType":"causes","targetEntity":"low_charge"}]}}
{"id":"gonsin-004","question":"GONSIN10000E 在会议系统中承担什么角色，可直接连接哪些主要设备？","referenceAnswer":"它是会议系统的核心，也是系统硬件与控制软件之间连接及控制的桥梁；可连接有线会议终端、无线会议终端、无线 AP、电源 HUB，并可通过接口连接摄像机、监视器、数字音频处理器、调音台、功放、电脑和 U 盘等。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"系统概述","tags":["综合型","设备连接"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"server-role-devices","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-4"],"sectionPath":"2.4 会议服务器的连接","quoteText":"会议服务器 GONSIN10000E 是会议系统的核心部分"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[{"canonicalName":"gonsin_10000e","aliases":["GONSIN10000E"]},{"canonicalName":"Wireless_AP","aliases":["无线 AP"]},{"canonicalName":"WiredConferenceTerminal","aliases":["有线会议终端"]},{"canonicalName":"WirelessConferenceTerminal","aliases":["无线会议终端"]}],"requiredRelations":[{"sourceEntity":"gonsin_10000e","relationType":"contains","targetEntity":"Wireless_AP"}]}}
{"id":"gonsin-005","question":"GONSIN10000E 默认最多可同时开启多少个话筒？","referenceAnswer":"默认最多可同时开启 5 个话筒。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"系统参数","tags":["事实型","话筒"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"default-open-mics","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-4"],"quoteText":"默认最多可同时开启数量为5个"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[],"requiredRelations":[]}}
{"id":"gonsin-006","question":"使用 GONSIN10000E 前面板 USB 接口录音时，U 盘应采用什么格式，支持哪些录制方式？","referenceAnswer":"U 盘应为 FAT32 格式，支持手动或自动录制音频，并可显示录音状态。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"录音功能","tags":["事实型","接口"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"usb-recording","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-4"],"quoteText":"插入U盘（FAT32格式）支持手动/自动录制音频"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[{"canonicalName":"USBRecordingPort"},{"canonicalName":"gonsin_10000e"}],"requiredRelations":[{"sourceEntity":"gonsin_10000e","relationType":"contains","targetEntity":"USBRecordingPort"}]}}
{"id":"gonsin-007","question":"GONSIN10000E 如何安装到机柜中，占用多少机柜空间？","referenceAnswer":"可安装在标准 19 英寸机柜中，占 2U；先拆下机身两侧螺丝，用这些螺丝固定随附的两个支架，再放入机柜并用机柜螺丝拧紧。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"安装","tags":["操作型","机柜"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"rack-installation","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-4"],"quoteText":"可安装在标准 19 英寸机柜上，占 2U 的空间"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[],"requiredRelations":[]}}
{"id":"gonsin-008","question":"会议服务器与无线会议终端通信为什么需要无线 AP？AP 数量较多或距离主机较远时如何供电和连接？","referenceAnswer":"无线 AP 负责会议服务器与无线终端之间的信号收发转换。AP 较少且离主机近时可直连主机 POE 口；有 2 个及以上或距离较远时，可用 PoE 适配器或 220V 适配器供电，也可用 PoE 网管交换机扩展连接。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"设备连接","tags":["综合型","无线AP"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"ap-required","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-5"],"quoteText":"必须通过一台或者多台无线 AP 进行信号的收 发转换"}]},{"id":"ap-power-options","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-5"],"quoteText":"如果 AP 数量 2 个或以上，距离主机偏远可以选择使用 Poe 适配器"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[{"canonicalName":"meeting_server","aliases":["会议服务器"]},{"canonicalName":"Wireless_AP","aliases":["无线 AP"]}],"requiredRelations":[{"sourceEntity":"meeting_server","relationType":"depends_on","targetEntity":"Wireless_AP"}]}}
{"id":"gonsin-009","question":"电源 HUB 的 FAULT 灯亮时应检查什么？延长线达到多少米时需要再增加一台电源 HUB？","referenceAnswer":"应检查 HUB 后面连接的终端数量是否超载；延长线达到 60 米时，需要在后面增加一台电源 HUB。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"故障排查","tags":["故障型","电源HUB"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"hub-fault-extension","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-5"],"quoteText":"如果电源 HUB 的电源故障指示灯'FAULT'亮"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[],"requiredRelations":[]}}
{"id":"gonsin-010","question":"GONSIN10000E 支持哪些摄像机控制协议和波特率？","referenceAnswer":"支持 PELCO-P 和索尼 VISCA 协议，波特率为 9600。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"摄像控制","tags":["参数型","协议"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"camera-protocols","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-5"],"quoteText":"支持 PELCO-P 协议和索尼 VISCA 协议的摄像机，波特率为 9600"},{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-8"],"quoteText":"支持与摄像机的通讯协议 为:PELCO-P9600和VISCA"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[{"canonicalName":"gonsin_10000e","aliases":["GONSIN10000E"]},{"canonicalName":"pelco_p9600","aliases":["PELCO-P9600"]}],"requiredRelations":[{"sourceEntity":"gonsin_10000e","relationType":"custom:supports_protocol","targetEntity":"pelco_p9600"}]}}
{"id":"gonsin-011","question":"DCS-1013 无线会议终端在首次开机后一直连不上主机，多久会自动关机？已正常连接后断信号多久会自动关机？","referenceAnswer":"首次开机后 10 分钟内连不上会自动关机；正常连接后若失去信号且 3 分钟内未恢复，也会自动关机。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"终端操作","tags":["事实型","自动关机"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"terminal-auto-shutdown","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-6"],"quoteText":"第一次单元开机后，如果10分钟内连不上，自动关机"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[{"canonicalName":"auto_shutdown"},{"canonicalName":"dcs_1013cg_w"}],"requiredRelations":[{"sourceEntity":"auto_shutdown","relationType":"implements","targetEntity":"dcs_1013cg_w"}]}}
{"id":"gonsin-012","question":"DCS-1013 终端错误码 E1、E2、E7、E8、E9 分别表示什么？","referenceAnswer":"E1 表示重号；E2 表示开咪申请失败；E7 表示 3 分钟内无法获取 IP，会重连一次 AP；E8 表示网卡出错；E9 表示声卡出错。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"故障排查","tags":["列表型","错误码"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"error-codes","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-6"],"quoteText":"错误码E1：重号；错误码E2：开咪申请失败"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[{"canonicalName":"mic_failure"},{"canonicalName":"error_code_e2"}],"requiredRelations":[{"sourceEntity":"mic_failure","relationType":"causes","targetEntity":"error_code_e2"}]}}
{"id":"gonsin-013","question":"单台 HUB-P150S 在关闭监听和打开监听时分别可挂载多少台会议终端？","referenceAnswer":"关闭监听时标准可挂载 65 台，打开监听时可挂载 25 台会议终端。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"设备参数","tags":["参数型","电源HUB"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"hub-capacity","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-6"],"quoteText":"单台电源 HUB150S 标准可挂载 65 台会议终端（关闭监听）/25台会议终端（打开监听）"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[{"canonicalName":"hub_p150s","aliases":["HUB-P150S"]}],"requiredRelations":[]}}
{"id":"gonsin-014","question":"如何登录 GONSIN10000E 的 WEB 页面？默认 IP、账号和密码分别是什么？","referenceAnswer":"操作电脑通过网线连接主机，在浏览器访问 192.168.10.2/；默认账号为 10000E，密码为 123456。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"WEB管理","tags":["操作型","登录"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"web-login","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-6"],"quoteText":"主机出厂默认 IP 为：192.168.10.2"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[],"requiredRelations":[]}}
{"id":"gonsin-015","question":"讨论控制中的标准模式、PPT 模式和批准模式分别如何处理代表话筒？批准模式在什么条件下生效？","referenceAnswer":"标准模式按下打断键后会自动关闭其他代表话筒；PPT 模式按下时让其他代表话筒静音、松开后取消静音；批准模式按下即批准申请发言的话筒，且仅当主机处于申请发言模式时生效。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"讨论控制","tags":["比较型","发言模式"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"discussion-modes","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-7"],"quoteText":"【标准模式】：按下打断键后其他代表话筒自动关咪"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[{"canonicalName":"discussion_control"},{"canonicalName":"StandardMode"},{"canonicalName":"PPTMode"},{"canonicalName":"ApprovalMode"}],"requiredRelations":[{"sourceEntity":"discussion_control","relationType":"implements","targetEntity":"StandardMode"},{"sourceEntity":"discussion_control","relationType":"implements","targetEntity":"PPTMode"},{"sourceEntity":"discussion_control","relationType":"implements","targetEntity":"ApprovalMode"}]}}
{"id":"gonsin-016","question":"公信 WAP-10D 无线 AP 支持哪些频段和安装方式？","referenceAnswer":"支持 2.4G、5.2G、5.8G 三个频段，并支持吸顶、壁挂、桌面放置三种安装方式。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"无线AP","tags":["参数型","安装"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"ap-bands-installation","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-7"],"quoteText":"支持2.4G/5.2G/5.8G三个无线通信频段"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[{"canonicalName":"GonsinWirelessAP","aliases":["WAP-10D"]}],"requiredRelations":[]}}
{"id":"gonsin-017","question":"配置无线 AP 时，固定 IP 范围和要求的最低信号强度分别是多少？","referenceAnswer":"固定 IP 范围为 192.168.10.11～192.168.10.14；信号强度需要保持在 -70dB 以上。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"无线AP","tags":["跨点综合","网络参数"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"ap-ip-range","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-7"],"quoteText":"IP范围192.168.10.11-14"}]},{"id":"ap-signal-threshold","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-7"],"quoteText":"需要保证在-70db以上"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[],"requiredRelations":[]}}
{"id":"gonsin-018","question":"TL-POE160S 的输入、输出参数及网线距离要求是什么？","referenceAnswer":"输入为 220V~、50Hz、0.3A；输出为 48VDC、0.35A（+4,5 pins；-7,8 pins）；10Base-T 和 100Base-T 均使用 5 类或以上 UTP/STP，距离不超过 100 米。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"设备参数","tags":["参数型","POE"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"poe-module-specs","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-7"],"quoteText":"输入参数：220V~ 50Hz 0.3A"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[{"canonicalName":"POESupplyModule","aliases":["TL-POE160S"]},{"canonicalName":"GonsinWirelessAP"}],"requiredRelations":[{"sourceEntity":"GonsinWirelessAP","relationType":"custom:powered_by","targetEntity":"POESupplyModule"}]}}
{"id":"gonsin-019","question":"有线或无线会议终端无法开咪时，应按什么顺序排查？","referenceAnswer":"先启动会议服务器和无线 AP，并确认二者完全启动后再开无线终端；检查 AP 与服务器的连接和接口；检查终端 SSID 与 AP 是否一致；若接入路由器或网管交换机，应关闭主机 DHCP，避免 IP 冲突。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"故障排查","tags":["故障型","开咪"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"terminal-mic-troubleshooting","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-8"],"sectionPath":"附：","quoteText":"有线/无线会议终端无法开咪"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[{"canonicalName":"wireless_terminal","aliases":["无线会议终端"]},{"canonicalName":"Wireless_AP","aliases":["无线AP"]}],"requiredRelations":[{"sourceEntity":"wireless_terminal","relationType":"depends_on","targetEntity":"Wireless_AP"}]}}
{"id":"gonsin-020","question":"说明书给出的会议服务器、无线 AP、网关和子网掩码地址分别是什么？","referenceAnswer":"会议服务器主机模式为 192.168.10.2、备机模式为 192.168.9.1；无线 AP 为 192.168.10.11～192.168.10.14；所有设备网关为 192.168.10.254；子网掩码为 255.255.224.0。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"网络参数","tags":["列表型","IP地址"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"device-ip-addresses","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-8"],"quoteText":"会议服务器GONSIN10000E, 1 = 主机模式：192.168.10.2"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[],"requiredRelations":[]}}
{"id":"gonsin-021","question":"会议服务器音频接口无输出、无线终端监听却有声音且服务器显示“锁定”时，原因和处理方法是什么？","referenceAnswer":"原因是服务器启用了授权使用功能并已到指定暂停时间。应在会议服务器液晶菜单中进入“高级”，输入密码并重新设置授权。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"故障排查","tags":["故障型","授权"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"locked-audio-fix","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-8"],"quoteText":"是由于会议服务器开启了授权使用功能"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[],"requiredRelations":[]}}
{"id":"gonsin-022","question":"为保证 10000E 系统稳定，网线应满足哪些要求？为什么需要屏蔽层？","referenceAnswer":"建议使用带屏蔽的超五类网线，线径 0.45mm 以上，两端使用带金属屏蔽的水晶头，并让水晶头屏蔽壳与网线屏蔽层连接。屏蔽层可把人体静电泄放到主机 GND，避免静电在终端内部累积。","documentId":"f129de80-b0e9-4df4-9736-d9ecac5bf91a","sourceContentHash":"183abbb19d477e96c61aacbe57c49a911b5ff9784538acf4aa18c94cd3f4e685","category":"布线要求","tags":["解释型","安全"],"evidenceGroups":[{"id":"shielded-cable-requirement","alternatives":[{"sourceBlockIds":["55975df1-28da-4a73-9502-c9762743f00d-8"],"quoteText":"建议采用的网线是带屏蔽的超五类网线"}]}],"expectedGraph":{"requiredEntities":[{"canonicalName":"gonsin_10000e"},{"canonicalName":"cat5e_cable"}],"requiredRelations":[{"sourceEntity":"gonsin_10000e","relationType":"custom:requires","targetEntity":"cat5e_cable"}]}}
